st temporal feature.\n\nTemporal availability is limited because masked traffic history can itself be missing.\n\nCurrent feature construction was performed per daily masked file.\n\nPotential future investigation:\nCarry legitimate temporal history across day boundaries instead of resetting lags at midnight.\n\n\n## Validation Warning\n\nCELL 11 overall displayed scores were row-weighted.\nOfficial Task 1 scoring averages regime scores.\n\nFuture official-style evaluation should use:\nmean(R1 score, R2 score, R3 score)\n\nDo not confuse row-weighted and regime-averaged scores.\n\n\n## NEXT STEP\n\nDo NOT immediately perform blind hyperparameter tuning.\n\nFirst investigate:\n\n1. Why catastrophic congestion cases occur.\n2. Whether lag-1 is missing in those cases.\n3. What other lag/history information is available.\n4. Whether cross-day temporal history can be carried safely.\n5. Whether traffic-state/context features can identify congestion when recent history is unavailable.\n6. Whether repeated difficult links have systematic behavior.\n\nOnly after this investigation should model tuning or feature redesign be performed.\n\n\n## Checkpoint Status\n\nStage 3 Feature Engineering:\nIN PROGRESS\n\nCells 01–12:\nCOMPLETE\n\nCurrent best working model:\nXGBoost\nPhysical + temporal features\n\nNext:\nCELL 14 — Missing-History + Congestion Investigation\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(\n    CHECKPOINT_DIR / \"STAGE3_HANDOFF.md\",\n    \"w\",\n    encoding=\"utf-8\"\n) as f:\n    f.write(handoff)\n\nprint(\"✓ Handoff document saved\")\n\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------\n# 6. List checkpoint files and sizes\n# ------------------------------------------------------------\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 80)\nprint(\"CHECKPOINT ARTIFACTS\")\nprint(\"=\" * 80)\n\nfor path in sorted(CHECKPOINT_DIR.iterdir()):\n    size_mb = path.stat().st_size / (1024 ** 2)\n\n    print(\n        f\"{path.name:<35} \"\n        f\"{size_mb:>10.2f} MB\"\n    )\n\n\nprint(\"\\n